# Alygn Agent Plane

Environment variables for the Kill Switch agent. Copy to `.env` and fill in.

## Required

```
# Mother machine (the kill-switch server) — where heartbeats are sent
ALYGN_MOTHER_URL=http://localhost:3000

# API key for authenticating with the mother machine
# (matches KILL_SWITCH_API_KEY on the mother's kill-switch server)
ALYGN_AGENT_API_KEY=***

# Unique machine identifier for this agent instance
ALYGN_MACHINE_ID=machine-local-001
```

## Optional

```
# Human-readable machine name (default: local-machine)
ALYGN_MACHINE_NAME=local-machine

# Network hostname for this machine (default: localhost)
ALYGN_MACHINE_HOSTNAME=localhost

# Heartbeat interval in milliseconds (default: 30000)
ALYGN_HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_MS=30000

# Ollama endpoint for interception (the REAL Ollama — default 11434)
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434

# Port the agent listens on to intercept Ollama traffic (default 11436).
# The agent proxies :11436 → OLLAMA_BASE_URL (:11434), so clients point
# at the agent instead of Ollama directly.
# NOTE: 11435 is owned by nginx (admin-ui.conf serves Ollama over TLS there).
OLLAMA_INTERCEPT_PORT=11436

# Enforcement poll interval in milliseconds (default: 5000)
ALYGN_ENFORCE_POLL_INTERVAL_MS=5000

# Local state database path (SQLite WAL; default: ./data/agent-state.sqlite)
ALYGN_STATE_DB=./data/agent-state.sqlite

# Log level: debug | info | warn | error
LOG_LEVEL=info
```
